            </calendar>
         </calendarDesc>
         <particDesc>
            <p>A person called <persName ref="people:CIr002">Dādēn</persName> gives three grīw of wheat to <persName ref="people:CIr003">Māhwindād son of Zōrdār</persName>.</p>
            <p>The date of the transaction is month Spandarmad of 49 PY, equivalent to May-June 701 CE.</p>
            <p>The document is sealed by <persName ref="people:CIr001" type="seal">Frāy</persName>.</p>
         </particDesc>
         <creation>
            <date when="0049-12" calendar="#Pahlavi">Spandarmad 49 PY</date>
            <date when="0701-05" calendar="#Julian">May-June 701 CE</date>
         </creation>
      </profileDesc>
   </teiHeader>
   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85222-8.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0008_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/><persName ref="people:CIr002">dʾṭyn'</persName> MN ZK Y ʿL
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>bwn' ZNH BYRḤ
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>spndrmṭ Y ŠNṬ
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>40–3-3–3 lwčyk
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>lʾd Ḥg G+3
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>ʿL <persName ref="people:CIr003">mʾhwndʾṭ</persName> Y
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/><persName ref="people:CIr003">zʾwldʾl</persName> YḤBWNṭ' čk'
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/><persName ref="people:CIr001">plʾd</persName> ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0008_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/><persName ref="people:CIr002">Dādēn</persName> az ān ī ō
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>bun ēn māh
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>Spandarmad ī sāl
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>49 rōzīg
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>rāy gandum 3 grīw
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>ō <persName ref="people:CIr003">Māh-vindād</persName> ī
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/><persName ref="people:CIr003">Zōrdār</persName> dād čak
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/><persName ref="people:CIr001" type="seal">Frāy</persName> āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="fr">
            <ab xml:id="MP0008_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Dādēn, de ce qui (est) dans
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>le patrimoine, ce mois de
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>de Spandarmad de l’an
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>49, comme ration
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>a remis trois grīw de blé
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>à Māh-vindād fils de
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>Zōrdār. Le document,
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>Frāy l’a scellé.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>